 shoulder) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Connect up to 4 controllers </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RMB + LMB + Scrollwheel </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD + E + SPACE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IJKL + O + ENTER </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow keys + SHIFT + M </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Axis + START + A</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Accessibility features </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Ability to entirely customise the palettes used ingame<br>- Can disable camera shake, rapid camera movements, photosensitive mode, plus change camera speed in settings<br>- 4 Different volume controls to give further control to filter out any particular noises that are bothersome</p>","developers":["Follow the fun"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163770/f290d9de35e756d1349e8de393e6501632ac16d0/header.jpg?t=1768800365","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4163770/660544112/e5cfe5e2e143529bd16fd2329d342a55caa57c44/1767849525/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767849865","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4163770/660544112/e5cfe5e2e143529bd16fd2329d342a55caa57c44/1767849525/dash_h264.mpd?t=1767849865","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4163770/660544112/e5cfe5e2e143529bd16fd2329d342a55caa57c44/1767849525/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1767849865","id":257227395,"name":"Launch zero","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257227395/969c68d7cf45012d45e62e9765fb7c6e6aaedee2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1767849865"}],"name":"Out of Order zero",